          "en": "and you learned how authentication works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.17,
          "end": 17.1,
          "en": "that we validate credentials and then create this cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.1,
          "end": 20.13,
          "en": "which is then stored in the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
